WEBVTT

00:08:28.552 --> 00:08:30.499
bez krivina na serifima.

00:08:30.499 --> 00:08:32.915
Bili su poligonalni,
sastavljeni od pravih linija,

00:08:32.915 --> 00:08:34.898
zarubljenih ivica

00:08:34.898 --> 00:08:39.266
A vidite da i štedi prostor
poput bezserifnog.

00:08:39.266 --> 00:08:41.565
To desno smo nazvali Čarter.

00:08:41.565 --> 00:08:43.535
Uzeo sam proračune i otišao

00:08:43.535 --> 00:08:45.993
kod glavnog inženjera i ponosno rekao:

00:08:45.993 --> 00:08:48.121
,,Rešio sam problem.''

00:08:48.121 --> 00:08:51.834
Pitao me je: ,,Koji problem?''

00:08:51.834 --> 00:08:53.480
Rekoh: ,,Znate, problem

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:56.897
sa prevelikim serifnim fontovima
i tako dalje.''

00:08:56.897 --> 00:09:00.444
,,A to. To smo rešili prošle nedelje.